 Expert?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">See the key skills and requirements laid out above to see if you have what it takes to become an Excel Expert.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Think you know Excel? We are recruiting for a variety of Excel freelance jobs including VBA, training and consultancy roles.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":30537,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[16],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-31402","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-education"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Excel Freelance Jobs: Launch Your Career With Us! - The Excel Experts<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Think you know Excel? We are recruiting for a variety of Excel freelance jobs including VBA, training and consultancy roles.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-freelance-jobs\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Excel Freelance Jobs: Launch Your Career With Us! - The Excel Experts\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Think you know Excel? We are recruiting for a variety of Excel freelance jobs including VBA, training and consultancy roles.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-freelance-jobs\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"The Excel Experts\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"202